  "answer": "Augustin is the Dean of St. Marvells and the brother of Georgiana. He is the father of Salome and Sheba, and a friend of Sir Tristram Mardon. In the events involving Sir Tristram and the Dean's family, Augustin is the head of the Deanery household, where Sir Tristram and his horse Dandy Dick are brought. He is concerned about his reputation and the impact of the horse's presence on his position, and he is involved in the subsequent scandal over the horse's doping.",
